  (wire (pts (xy 313.69 168.91) (xy 306.07 168.91)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "df1e549c-bc09-58d2-959a-1b65cce3d9a7"))
  (wire (pts (xy 313.69 171.45) (xy 306.07 171.45)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "a8bc2da8-7514-5d3e-a17f-5213197886de"))
  (text "FRONT-PANEL LINK - three 2x20 straight male headers on the BOTTOM side of the main board (v0.8)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7e644150-3627-53ff-a9fd-d5d47536da7b"))
  (text "The panel stacks flat on the BACK of the main board (Decision #45). J6/J7/J8 are mounted on the BOTTOM side of the main board and hand-soldered from the top; they mate the panel's three female headers. Positions along the 180 mm edge: x ~ 12 (J6), x ~ 90 (J7)," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2957efde-ae55-5dfd-a395-ed7e98947f81"))
  (text "x ~ 168 (J8) mm." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bc2d5302-4675-5c87-9ef7-59518a507349"))
  (text "Odd pins = row 1 (signal), even pins = row 2 (return): every signal pin has its return, AGND or GND, on the adjacent even pin. The whole even row of a header is one net, so it is drawn as one comb with a single symbol. J6 carries the analog signals (nearest" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "53ba2d79-94fe-548b-9258-7a595acdfa2b"))
  (text "the panel SMAs), J7 the digital ones, J8 the rails, the free GPIO, the seven module outputs MODULE OUT 1..7 and the two isolated-input returns OPTO_IN1/2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21b27b9f-ddd0-5fe2-89ef-2d9d95ce97cc"))
  (text "LED_PWR is +3V3 (always on; the LED series resistor sits on the panel). LED_WIFI / LED_ACT come from GPIO43 / GPIO44 through JP1 / JP2 (base sheet). GPIO4/6/7/15/43/44 on J8 are the same nets as on the expansion header J5. TX is on two pins (19 and 21) so the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 31.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2abbf92c-f6d0-5e7a-be04-f835d458764d"))
  (text "coil current has two paths." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b625d1b8-5acf-5b2c-aea5-2d795398e6d6"))
  (text "Pins marked spare are not connected on the main board; on the panel they reach labelled test pads, so a later panel part needs no new main-board revision. Panel copper is AGND and meets GND only at the star point NT1 on the main board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 38.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "403d8d75-2a41-52bb-81dc-f8e9bc214e92"))
  (text "The three headers (and the panel's three female headers) are bought separately and soldered by the instructor: they carry the field Assembly = hand and are excluded from the JLC BOM and CPL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 41.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f638412a-2f49-502e-9487-d5eb2862ef12"))
  (text "J6 - analog, at x = 12 mm on the bottom side" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 34 112 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "be8bc75a-5bda-5857-835e-97b97a5b4afc"))
  (text "J6 pin table" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 198 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "927cb2e9-748c-573f-9160-ee8184947ce7"))
  (text "J7 - digital, at x = 90 mm on the bottom side" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 164 112 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bf6797fe-17d2-5aa2-85e6-f77ba9583050"))
  (text "J7 pin table" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152 198 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dd7f01b3-da7a-5d21-913a-59ce8e68f6b6"))
  (text "J8 - rails, GPIO, module outputs, at x = 168 mm on the bottom side" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 294 112 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "75aa87ac-6869-5a9c-8ba7-0d06250e5d29"))
  (text "J8 pin table" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 284 198 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "82cd667a-37c4-5660-8fb9-029c3ea5f9c5"))
  (text "Pin 29 of J7 (LED_PWR) is +3V3 directly; the panel LED series resistor sits on the panel PCB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 265 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dfedeed1-5c64-51e2-a876-e68c260cf9f2"))
  (text "MODULE OUT 1..7 (J8 pins 19-31 odd) are 3.3 V logic from the TCA9535 expander: the panel buffers them to 5 V TTL to drive commercial" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 268.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cf12820d-c166-55f6-8d4a-ad876d813bd7"))
  (text "opto-isolated relay modules (5 mA per input). MODULE OUT 8 (pin 33) is RESERVED: no expander port is free for it, so it is not connected" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 272 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bf1e7392-89cc-5986-8be1-5e9ecc66003b"))
  (text "on the main board and the panel pulls it down. OPTO_IN1/2 (pins 35, 37) come the other way: the two 6N137 isolated inputs live on the panel" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 275.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "99549ac6-ed1a-5fa2-88e9-a28097efa993"))
  (text "and their open-collector outputs reach GPIO16/17 here. Spare pins: J6 has 6 (29-39 odd), J7 has 3 (35-39 odd), J8 has 2 (33, 39)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 279 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fa65c2bb-96d2-5c9c-96f7-836a83e9dc3a"))
